      "markdown": "# Research observations: synthetic example\n\nAll values and sources are fictional. These panels keep valuation estimates, news-derived attention proxies, and business observations separate. They do not estimate true value or recommend trades. October 3 is missing, not zero or evidence that attention cooled. October 5 has a genuine zero news-source count. The evidence table below keeps each missing reason visible even when a chart has no mark to hover. Source links are reserved example.com placeholders."
    },
